  page/dim:"+----------------------------------------------+"

-- the ruling (C10 §4k.2 row 6)
  nothing is contested · staleness dims the content and names its age · the spinner keeps the duration slot"
`;

exports[`C10 §4k — the compositions, as frames > the owed compositions name the change that would give each a subject 1`] = `
"2 · hovering one link while another has keyboard focus
    the subject is a link and none exists in the view model; R-PTR-003 admits hover on links, buttons and chips only, and links are built first as their own MR (C10 §4k.4)"
`;
